WEBVTT

00:03.060 --> 00:04.400
<i>Oh, come on!</i>

00:04.400 --> 00:06.360
<i>I'm running late for the start of our new life together!?</i>

00:06.360 --> 00:08.780
<i>That's pathetic. So pathetic!</i>

00:16.210 --> 00:19.080
<i>There aren't any trains left! Let's see...</i>

00:21.330 --> 00:23.210
Shingo-san.

00:27.540 --> 00:29.320
I-I'm sorry!

00:29.320 --> 00:32.090
Interviewing the witnesses took longer than I expected,

00:32.770 --> 00:35.260
and then, well...

00:37.460 --> 00:38.600
I'm just kidding.

00:40.290 --> 00:42.770
I know that police officers
have a lot of work to do.

00:43.370 --> 00:45.080
Y-Yeah...

00:46.010 --> 00:46.770
But...

00:47.450 --> 00:50.230
I don't want us to keep missing each other.

00:50.230 --> 00:52.650
Can you buy me a smartphone?

00:53.820 --> 00:54.990
S-Sure.

00:55.330 --> 00:58.610
I'm looking forward to living with you again.

00:58.610 --> 01:01.370
M-Me too.

01:07.480 --> 01:08.800
<i>We finally...</i>

01:09.310 --> 01:11.760
<i>We finally get to be a family again,</i>

01:12.660 --> 01:14.030
<i>but...</i>

01:17.490 --> 01:18.340
Poochi!

01:19.060 --> 01:21.000
Why are you after my daughter?

01:21.500 --> 01:22.770
What are you?

01:23.040 --> 01:25.110
Wh-What are you doing, Shin-kun?

01:25.110 --> 01:26.350
Am I on Punk'd?

01:26.350 --> 01:29.090
We both know by now that the perps of these attacks are either demons,

01:29.090 --> 01:31.860
or someone manipulating
them behind the scenes.

01:31.860 --> 01:35.890
And with nearly every attack concerning the demons, the Exorcist Girl gets herself involved.

01:35.890 --> 01:38.000
Shin-kun! Listen to me!

01:38.290 --> 01:44.390
At first, I thought she was showing up to exorcise the demons,

01:45.100 --> 01:46.080
but I was wrong.

01:47.000 --> 01:49.630
She wasn't after the demons.

01:50.270 --> 01:52.850
They were after her!

01:52.850 --> 01:53.460
Huh?

01:53.460 --> 01:57.130
And then the demons and Exorcist Girl
followed us to Tenkai Beach,

01:57.130 --> 01:58.800
our secluded vacation spot.

01:59.110 --> 02:00.760
This makes it clear

02:00.760 --> 02:03.640
that the person behind the attack knew both the Exorcist Girl's true identity

02:03.640 --> 02:06.350
and that we were off on vacation.

02:06.350 --> 02:09.610
A-And you think that makes me the culprit!?

02:09.610 --> 02:12.360
I also saw a post on the Exorcist Girl's twitter

02:12.360 --> 02:16.070
about demons in the Kamagaya shopping district.

02:16.070 --> 02:19.200
I traced that tweet back to your computer.

02:19.200 --> 02:22.800
Because a report about it came into the station!

02:22.800 --> 02:26.660
It wasn't something we could investigate,
so I thought I'd leave it to the Exorcist Girl!

02:26.660 --> 02:28.530
And then we have the initial report.

02:28.530 --> 02:31.630
I had a forensic investigator
analyze the recording,

02:31.630 --> 02:35.010
and they deemed the call
intentionally misleading and faked.

02:35.010 --> 02:38.650
And the voice print on the recording matched yours perfectly.

02:38.650 --> 02:40.100
Th-There must be a mistake!

02:40.100 --> 02:42.560
I didn't do anything!

02:42.560 --> 02:44.290
Someone's gotta be framing me!

02:44.290 --> 02:47.010
This ain't a police interrogation.

02:47.010 --> 02:50.120
I even borrowed this gun
from the lady at the IATO.

02:50.120 --> 02:51.540
Do you get it, Poochi?

02:51.540 --> 02:54.570
I'm not speaking to you as a police officer.

02:55.040 --> 02:57.730
I'm speaking to you as Matoi's father!

02:57.730 --> 02:59.080
Why are you after Matoi!?

02:59.080 --> 03:00.000
Answer me!

03:00.000 --> 03:02.000
I'm not a criminal!

03:02.410 --> 03:03.240
Really?

03:04.030 --> 03:04.870
I understand.

03:06.950 --> 03:06.990
{OP}

04:44.080 --> 04:47.740
And this is what we police call
"irrefutable evidence."

04:52.090 --> 04:53.680
Well done.

04:54.180 --> 04:57.300
I didn't think anyone had realized.

04:57.300 --> 04:59.770
So you finally reveal your true form!

04:59.770 --> 05:01.150
Poochi, you bastard, how long have you—

05:01.150 --> 05:05.270
You can shoot, but all you'll do is damage Hideo Tezuka's body.

05:05.270 --> 05:07.200
He doesn't know that I exist within him.

05:07.710 --> 05:10.920
And he doesn't know what I did while he was unconscious.

05:10.920 --> 05:12.800
Bastard! Are you a demon?

05:12.800 --> 05:15.140
If that's what you want to believe, so be it.

05:15.140 --> 05:19.190
More importantly, how long have you known that your daughter was an exorcist—

05:19.190 --> 05:21.650
rather, a shrine maiden of Divine Union?

05:21.650 --> 05:23.470
I'm the one asking the questions here!

05:23.470 --> 05:24.420
Answer me!

05:24.420 --> 05:26.600
Why are you after Matoi?

05:27.160 --> 05:30.620
I'll answer, but only out of respect for your deductive skills.

05:30.620 --> 05:33.940
I was never "after"
Sumeragi Matoi to begin with.

05:33.940 --> 05:35.770
I would personally put it as "guiding her."

05:35.770 --> 05:37.250
Guiding her!?

05:37.250 --> 05:38.230
That's right.

05:38.230 --> 05:43.000
Whether she wished for it or not,
she became a shrine maiden of Divine Union.

05:43.500 --> 05:48.310
In the eternal stream of time, the Cavitas was beginning to open as the dimensions twisted.

05:48.310 --> 05:54.400
With the fate of all dimensions entrusted to her,
she needed the power to shoulder that responsibility.

05:55.060 --> 05:57.340
I don't got a clue what shit you're spouting!

05:57.340 --> 05:59.300
Make it simple so an idiot can understand!

05:59.860 --> 06:02.180
This world will be destroyed, very soon.

06:02.790 --> 06:05.970
The only being who can save it is Sumeragi Matoi.

06:06.700 --> 06:11.500
Just as Sumeragi Shiori did ten years ago.

06:12.390 --> 06:14.210
S-Shiori did?

06:14.210 --> 06:17.280
And this time, it's her daughter's turn.

06:18.020 --> 06:19.550
Does Matoi know this!?

06:19.550 --> 06:21.190
Of course she knows.

06:21.190 --> 06:22.730
It's probably all she can think about.

06:22.730 --> 06:24.800
Why? Why her?

06:25.110 --> 06:30.030
Why do Shiori and Matoi have to get mixed up in something like this?

06:30.440 --> 06:33.420
There are no words for it other than "fate."

06:33.420 --> 06:37.420
If things such as gods and higher
dimensions can exist in this world,

06:37.420 --> 06:39.430
then their involvement isn't decided on a whim.

06:41.350 --> 06:44.300
Does it have to be Matoi?

06:44.300 --> 06:44.920
Indeed.

06:45.360 --> 06:47.000
There's no one else!?

06:47.780 --> 06:48.630
There isn't.

06:49.460 --> 06:51.250
Until I come back,

06:51.250 --> 06:53.190
take care of Matoi for me.

06:53.820 --> 06:55.210
Are you...

06:55.210 --> 06:57.690
Are you telling me to suffer that loss again?

06:58.670 --> 07:02.150
Should you want to stop
Sumeragi Matoi, be my guest.

07:02.640 --> 07:05.400
As long as you two decide that together...

07:05.400 --> 07:07.350
W-Wait! I still have questions!

07:07.350 --> 07:09.240
The die has already been cast.

07:09.550 --> 07:14.210
All I can do now is watch as
the fate of the dimensions are decided.

07:14.900 --> 07:17.970
The ones to choose that fate are the beings of this world.

07:17.970 --> 07:19.200
You two.

07:23.220 --> 07:24.930
What is all this?

07:24.930 --> 07:26.290
Some kinda joke?

07:26.960 --> 07:29.780
Not just Shiori, but Matoi too?

07:29.780 --> 07:32.480
Are they <i>both</i> going to leave me?

07:33.410 --> 07:35.220
Are they <i>both</i> going to disappear?

07:42.930 --> 07:44.940
When the hole opened ten years ago,

07:44.940 --> 07:48.360
we dispatched a shrine maiden to the highest dimension.

07:48.360 --> 07:53.570
That maiden was Kusanagi Shiori,
Matoi's mother.

07:54.100 --> 07:55.830
In order to avoid a disaster,

07:55.830 --> 08:00.930
someone needs to go to
the highest dimension once again.

08:02.320 --> 08:05.060
<i>I'm the only one who can avert calamity.</i>

08:05.060 --> 08:07.470
<i>I'm the only one who can go
to the highest dimension.</i>

08:08.320 --> 08:10.640
<i>And Mom is in the highest dimension, too.</i>

08:11.410 --> 08:14.870
<i>But even if I go, that doesn't
mean I'll get to see her,</i>

08:14.870 --> 08:17.340
<i>or that I'll be able to come back.</i>

08:18.820 --> 08:20.220
<i>Shingo-san...</i>

08:27.380 --> 08:29.200
<i>Hello!? Is that you, Matoi?</i>

08:29.200 --> 08:30.690
<i>It's Shingo!</i>

08:30.690 --> 08:32.850
Why are you so worked up?

08:32.850 --> 08:34.200
<i>What happened?</i>

08:34.200 --> 08:35.380
Well, uh...

08:35.380 --> 08:36.690
That's...

08:41.330 --> 08:46.000
Shingo-san, I couldn't visit you in the hospital today, I'm sorry.

08:46.320 --> 08:48.720
<i>I was at Yuma-chan's.</i>

08:48.720 --> 08:50.880
O-Oh. I see...

08:50.880 --> 08:52.000
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

08:52.450 --> 08:55.010
It's nothing you need to apologize for.

08:55.750 --> 08:56.760
I'm sorry.

08:58.770 --> 08:59.850
I'm so sorry.

09:00.270 --> 09:01.190
<i>Matoi?</i>

09:01.640 --> 09:02.500
You...

09:02.500 --> 09:03.310
Matoi!

09:10.310 --> 09:12.690
This world will be destroyed, very soon.

09:12.690 --> 09:14.200
The only being who can save it is...

09:17.810 --> 09:20.190
M-Matoi...

09:26.580 --> 09:28.790
I'm so sorry, Shingo-san.

09:29.950 --> 09:31.250
I just can't say it.

09:31.830 --> 09:34.720
What do I do?

09:34.720 --> 09:36.060
How can I...

09:38.010 --> 09:39.510
Matoi.

09:41.430 --> 09:44.130
Yayoi-san, why are you here?

09:44.130 --> 09:45.620
I apologize.

09:45.620 --> 09:47.980
There's something I wanted
to be sure I told you.

09:48.880 --> 09:52.160
May I have a moment of your time?

09:53.820 --> 09:54.820
This is terrible.

09:55.520 --> 09:57.920
It seems the countless battles with the Nights

09:57.920 --> 10:00.860
and the dimensional travel beyond your limits

10:01.570 --> 10:04.040
have severely damaged your Regalia.

10:04.890 --> 10:06.120
In this condition,

10:06.570 --> 10:08.960
you won't be able to access even half of your power.

10:09.970 --> 10:11.290
I'll fight.

10:11.920 --> 10:15.890
Banishing Nights is supposed to be Fatima's mission.

10:15.890 --> 10:16.670
Of course it is.

10:17.500 --> 10:22.000
But you're the only Anti-Creed
we have left, Clarus.

10:22.390 --> 10:23.850
I can't let you die for nothing.

10:23.850 --> 10:25.700
So you're telling me to sit back and watch?

10:25.700 --> 10:28.900
To entrust everything to Sumeragi Matoi?

10:28.900 --> 10:33.880
Until a few months ago,
she hadn't even heard of the Nights!

10:33.880 --> 10:36.350
That isn't the right thing to do.

10:36.350 --> 10:37.480
Clarus...

10:38.730 --> 10:41.070
I vowed...

10:41.970 --> 10:43.800
to never make any more mistakes.

10:44.320 --> 10:47.000
I won't let myself make
the same mistake again.

10:51.660 --> 10:53.350
Yuma...

10:53.350 --> 10:57.650
Nothing's gonna get better if you keep making that sour face.

10:57.650 --> 10:58.720
Takuto.

10:59.660 --> 11:00.630
Here.

11:00.630 --> 11:02.600
Alcohol at a time like this?

11:03.010 --> 11:04.890
We're purifying our spirits.

11:12.820 --> 11:14.550
When Yuma was a little girl...

11:14.550 --> 11:18.100
I saw her call those gods down,
and it scared me.

11:18.640 --> 11:22.870
I thought she was going to
disappear the way that Shiori did.

11:23.460 --> 11:28.340
I'm really grateful that you sealed them away.

11:28.340 --> 11:32.260
I just thought it was too
soon considering her age.

11:32.260 --> 11:36.850
Now that she's a shrine maiden
of Divine Union,  she must fulfill her duties.

11:36.850 --> 11:38.580
That's <i>all</i> you think?

11:38.580 --> 11:40.010
No...

11:41.310 --> 11:45.180
When I saw her gods, I was relieved.

11:45.700 --> 11:49.420
With those gods, there was no way
she could reach the highest dimension.

11:49.420 --> 11:51.980
I wouldn't have to lose her.

11:51.980 --> 11:54.170
I felt the same.

11:54.170 --> 11:56.140
I suppose it's natural as a parent.

11:56.780 --> 11:58.300
But...

11:58.300 --> 12:01.850
why must Shiori's daughter be the only one capable?

12:01.850 --> 12:06.180
Why must both mother and daughter shoulder such a harsh destiny?

12:06.880 --> 12:10.160
If that's how you feel, let's just stop.

12:10.160 --> 12:13.870
The Nights are akin to a natural disaster

12:13.870 --> 12:16.380
There's nothing the two of us can do.

12:16.820 --> 12:20.610
We'll just have Matoi and Yuma do all the dangerous work.

12:20.610 --> 12:24.550
Who cares if a world or two gets destroyed?

12:26.780 --> 12:27.890
No.

12:29.300 --> 12:30.850
If the world is destroyed,

12:30.850 --> 12:35.400
then my dreams of becoming a world
famous Exorcist Girl will get smashed to bits.

12:35.400 --> 12:36.260
Yuma...

12:36.260 --> 12:37.660
You...

12:37.660 --> 12:38.820
It'll be okay.

12:38.820 --> 12:41.610
I'll protect Toi-san and the world!

12:49.870 --> 12:52.010
I never knew this was back here.

12:59.470 --> 13:01.050
This is...

13:01.650 --> 13:03.330
Shiori-san—

13:03.330 --> 13:07.180
This is where your mother
departed for the highest dimension.

13:07.490 --> 13:09.080
Mom did?

13:09.080 --> 13:09.940
Yes.

13:12.280 --> 13:16.450
Do you want me to go to
the highest dimension too, Yayoi-san?

13:16.450 --> 13:18.230
Is that why you brought me here?

13:20.270 --> 13:25.400
I talked to her here before she left.

13:25.930 --> 13:28.820
I want to tell you what she told me.

13:29.210 --> 13:32.030
She left me with this:

13:32.030 --> 13:35.710
"I'm not going to the highest dimension just to protect the world.

13:36.000 --> 13:39.470
I'm going to protect the world
Matoi and Shingo are a part of."

13:40.480 --> 13:42.990
She didn't go because anyone forced her.

13:42.990 --> 13:47.600
She thought about what was important to her and made up her mind,

13:47.600 --> 13:50.590
and then made a wish to
her god to take her there.

13:52.280 --> 13:55.000
She made up her own mind...

13:55.370 --> 13:57.350
I've told you this before.

13:57.350 --> 14:00.940
The strength of our wishes becomes our power.

14:01.200 --> 14:05.700
Unless you wish for something from
the bottom of your heart, it won't come true.

14:06.520 --> 14:09.420
So whether or not to go to
the highest dimension is up to you

14:10.590 --> 14:12.490
You can decide on your own.

14:15.790 --> 14:17.830
I thought you might be here.

14:17.830 --> 14:19.360
Head Priestess!

14:19.360 --> 14:23.550
The IATO four-eyes with the big bosom still has something to tell us.

14:24.060 --> 14:25.860
We should head back to the shrine right away.

14:32.370 --> 14:35.560
As soon as you're ready, I need the
observation equipment set up ASAP.

14:35.560 --> 14:36.640
Roger!

14:37.130 --> 14:38.850
I've brought them.

14:38.850 --> 14:41.130
I'm terribly sorry we're late.

14:41.130 --> 14:43.700
Um... Has something happened?

14:43.700 --> 14:51.860
I received a report from the IATO headquarters
that the dimensional hole has stopped growing.

14:51.860 --> 14:54.260
The Gate of Caelum appears to be shrinking.

14:54.260 --> 14:56.640
Clarus can also confirm this.

14:56.640 --> 15:00.280
We won't have any further details until we begin our observations, but...

15:00.280 --> 15:02.350
It must be Shiori!

15:02.350 --> 15:08.360
Even now, she must be putting her life on the line to try and shut the gate!

15:08.360 --> 15:09.720
Mom is?

15:10.590 --> 15:14.970
There's no proof, of course,
but it's a reasonable guess.

15:15.840 --> 15:17.820
<i>Mom's alive.</i>

15:17.820 --> 15:19.610
<i>She's in the highest dimension.</i>

15:19.610 --> 15:23.590
<i>She's up there fighting for Shingo-san and me.</i>

15:24.330 --> 15:25.820
<i>Mom's...</i>

15:31.170 --> 15:32.570
God?

15:38.590 --> 15:39.370
Yeah.

15:40.160 --> 15:41.430
You're right.

15:42.420 --> 15:43.830
Please hear me out.

15:44.500 --> 15:47.100
I'm an ordinary girl.

15:47.400 --> 15:51.580
I had no idea what was happening when I was put in control of a god's power.

15:51.580 --> 15:53.800
And now, here I am as
a shrine maiden of Divine Union.

15:53.800 --> 15:58.890
But that doesn't change the fact that I'm just me,
an ordinary middle-school student.

15:58.890 --> 16:03.190
I can't do anything amazing
like saving the world.

16:04.180 --> 16:06.300
But even still...

16:17.930 --> 16:19.990
I think I'm going to go to the highest dimension.

16:20.780 --> 16:22.230
Toi-san.

16:22.230 --> 16:23.500
Matoi-san.

16:23.850 --> 16:28.440
My wish is to live together
with my mom and Shingo-san.

16:28.440 --> 16:31.620
So I want to use this special power of mine

16:32.340 --> 16:35.010
to get my mother back
from the highest dimension,

16:35.500 --> 16:39.140
and return to the ordinary life that I want.

16:40.470 --> 16:42.490
Are you sure about this?

16:42.490 --> 16:44.450
We won't force you.

16:44.450 --> 16:46.130
I've already made my decision.

16:46.770 --> 16:50.200
But before I go, there's one
last thing I have to do.

16:50.570 --> 16:52.530
Just give me a moment.

16:52.530 --> 16:53.820
Toi-san!

16:53.820 --> 16:55.110
I'm going—

17:00.680 --> 17:01.970
Toi-san...

17:09.150 --> 17:10.460
<i>Matoi.</i>

17:10.460 --> 17:12.120
That may be,

17:12.120 --> 17:14.720
but this isn't an incident
ordinary humans can handle.

17:15.460 --> 17:16.550
But...

17:16.870 --> 17:20.600
But that doesn't mean it's okay to worry your family!

17:22.000 --> 17:23.980
Your family will worry!

17:38.400 --> 17:41.250
<i>Just like Mom did...</i>

18:07.450 --> 18:12.220
I've always made Matoi worry, haven't I?

18:13.010 --> 18:14.570
I'll finish this soon.

18:14.890 --> 18:16.280
Please believe in me.

18:52.490 --> 18:54.950
I understand now.

18:57.410 --> 19:00.120
Isn't that right, Shiori?

19:13.290 --> 19:15.210
I'm going to keep believing in Shiori.

19:16.170 --> 19:19.170
Let's believe in her and wait for her together.

19:22.440 --> 19:24.710
Mom, I...

19:25.210 --> 19:28.300
I've always hated you, just a little bit, Mom.

19:28.730 --> 19:31.020
"Why would she leave me?"

19:31.260 --> 19:34.170
"Why hasn't she come home?"

19:34.170 --> 19:38.660
"Does she not love Shingo-san or me anymore?"

19:39.220 --> 19:40.120
But...

19:40.820 --> 19:43.390
But that was never the case!

19:43.390 --> 19:44.700
I'm so sorry.

19:45.190 --> 19:49.110
You never stopped being my mom!

19:51.690 --> 19:53.000
I'm on my way.

19:55.130 --> 19:56.340
I'm coming to get you!

20:09.330 --> 20:10.630
And just where do you think you're going?

20:11.260 --> 20:12.710
Shingo-san!

20:12.710 --> 20:14.580
Why? What about the hospital?

20:14.580 --> 20:19.070
I know it's summer vacation and all, but you stay out all night, and then try to sneak out <i>again</i>?

20:19.420 --> 20:23.680
I'd love to see the parents
who raised such a bad girl.

20:24.650 --> 20:25.660
If you need a mirror—

20:25.660 --> 20:26.660
Spare me the jokes.

20:29.070 --> 20:30.710
Those clothes suit you.

20:32.230 --> 20:33.580
Y-You think so?

20:33.580 --> 20:34.530
Yeah.

20:35.030 --> 20:36.230
Thank you.

20:37.950 --> 20:39.840
Where are you off to today?

20:41.810 --> 20:42.920
I'm going to go pick someone up.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.270
Someone who's important to me.

20:48.250 --> 20:49.510
I'd like to meet them.

20:50.440 --> 20:51.560
Shingo-san?

20:52.580 --> 20:55.460
That person who's so important to you.

20:58.480 --> 21:00.680
I'll be back as soon as I can.

21:00.680 --> 21:02.490
Don't do anything dangerous!

21:02.490 --> 21:05.200
I won't. Gosh. Trust me!

21:05.820 --> 21:06.450
I do.

21:07.130 --> 21:08.450
I'm heading out!

21:09.360 --> 21:10.360
Matoi!

21:10.360 --> 21:11.310
What?

21:11.310 --> 21:13.890
No, um... What did I want to say?

21:15.010 --> 21:16.400
B-Be careful.

21:16.890 --> 21:17.640
I will.

21:29.370 --> 21:30.720
<i>Shingo-san...</i>

21:31.650 --> 21:32.850
<i>I'm so sorry...</i>

21:36.480 --> 21:38.890
<i>that I could never say it.</i>

21:39.520 --> 21:40.310
<i>But...</i>

21:41.570 --> 21:45.680
<i>I think I'll be able to say it
when I bring Mom home.</i>

21:49.370 --> 21:51.100
<i>Dad.</i>

21:58.510 --> 22:00.170
Man, you gotta crappy fortune, Clarie-san!

22:00.170 --> 22:03.260
Toi-san, it says you'll never find true love!

22:03.260 --> 22:05.470
And even if you do, you'll
get dumped right away!

22:05.470 --> 22:07.680
I see. Too bad I don't believe in divination.

22:09.080 --> 22:10.690
You're inviting bad luck!

22:10.690 --> 22:13.660
I'll decide my own fate.

22:13.660 --> 22:14.930
Isn't that right?

22:15.720 --> 22:18.010
You guys... What are you doing here?

22:18.010 --> 22:18.940
Shouldn't that...

22:18.940 --> 22:20.850
...be obvious!?

22:21.560 --> 22:23.130
You're going to the highest dimension?

22:23.130 --> 22:25.440
Don't you understand? Your gods won't—

22:27.380 --> 22:29.070
If I say I'm going, I'm going!

22:29.070 --> 22:32.060
I'm going to protect Toi-san and the world!

22:32.060 --> 22:33.370
But...

22:33.370 --> 22:35.040
Go on.

22:35.040 --> 22:37.560
Yuma, women have to have courage.

22:37.560 --> 22:40.040
Make sure you keep Matoi safe!

22:41.320 --> 22:42.290
I will!

22:42.910 --> 22:44.210
So you're going after all?

22:44.210 --> 22:47.770
The Nights will be lying in wait in the upper dimensions.

22:47.770 --> 22:50.050
The more of us we have fighting, the better our chances.

22:51.420 --> 22:53.590
Quit lying to yourself.

22:54.380 --> 22:56.590
You're going because you want to.

22:57.220 --> 23:00.170
Not as an Anti-Creed of Fatima,

23:00.170 --> 23:02.100
but as Clarus Tonitrus,

23:02.820 --> 23:05.610
protecting what's important to her.

23:10.370 --> 23:12.900
The new school term starts tomorrow,

23:12.900 --> 23:14.850
so let's make this a day trip!

23:14.850 --> 23:16.010
Okay!

23:16.450 --> 23:17.950
I'll do my best.

23:23.580 --> 23:24.870
Divine Union!

23:44.920 --> 23:45.900
<i>We'll make...</i>

23:46.390 --> 23:47.610
<i>...this wish...</i>

23:48.350 --> 23:49.860
<i>...come true!</i>

23:56.870 --> 23:59.120
Like when it rains,
and you take out your umbrella.

23:59.370 --> 24:01.960
Like when you meet someone,
and you want to see them smile.

24:02.810 --> 24:05.380
Like when your family is
nothing but your family.

24:06.380 --> 24:08.130
Next time, "Ordinary is Best!"

24:08.460 --> 24:11.010
"Matoi the Sacred Slayer" concludes!
